  "Title": "Summing Amplifier",
  "Description": "Multi-input operational amplifier summing amplifier (audio/signal mixer) with dual split DC supply (+15V, -15V, middle GND reference), two weighted channel inputs (V1 = 1.0V, V2 = 2.0V, R1 = R2 = 10 kOhm), feedback resistor Rf = 10 kOhm producing inverted sum Vout = -(V1 + V2) = -3.0V at virtual ground summing junction.",
